sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Automation signed in as you
  participant API as Servant API memory
  participant Q as Push queue on disk
  participant W as Push worker
  participant D as Your other device
  R->>API: POST code request with label, hint and length
  API->>API: Keep code request in memory only
  API->>Q: Queue alert without the code
  W->>Q: Read pending alert
  W->>D: Push "Code needed" if unexpired
  API-->>D: Live event carries only request id
  D->>API: Fetch request and show Enter code
  D->>API: Answer over encrypted API
  R->>API: Claim once from asking device
  API-->>R: Return code, then forget it
